    {"id":"quiz-8","question":"Pick correct form","sentence":"I forgot ___ the letter.","options":["mailing","to mail","mail","mailed"],"correctAnswer":"to mail","audio":"after_quiz8.mp3","hint":"Forgot + infinitive (missed action).","difficulty":"hard","explanation":"Forgot to means didn’t do it."},
